                <head>[Subinclosure 3.]</head>
                <p>Extract from letter to A. B. Alexander from H. I. Hibbert, captain of the British
                    cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Latona</hi>, dated December 15, 1905:</p>
                <p>“I should like to take this opportunity of thanking you for the great courtesy
                    and kindness you have shown me in all matters in which we have had any dealings.
                    I am so thankful that everything has passed off quietly and without any
                    troubles, and I am convinced that this result is mainly due to the excellent
                    advice and counsel given by you to the fishing skippers.”</p>
            </div>
        </body>
